   "value": "<p><strong>Cost:</strong> 500eb (Expensive) <strong>♦</strong> <strong>Required Slots:</strong> 1</p>\n<p><strong>Fits:</strong> All Ranged Weapons capable of Autofire or Suppressive Fire</p>\n<p><em>A classic muzzle brake that reduces recoil during automatic fire.</em></p>\n<p>Provides a +1 bonus to Autofire Checks made with the weapon. Incurs a -1 penalty to Checks made to conceal the weapon under clothing. Incompatible with any other muzzle-based attachment.</p>\n<p><strong>Attachment slots:</strong> 1</p>\n<p><strong>Foundry notes:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>+1 to Autofire checks (toggle the situational modifier in the roll dialog).</li>\n</ul>\n<p><em>From <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/13EnSAoiLDsC7zmL-Jr1RqIh_EnuVuFnExqiipDVquMk/edit\">Corgo's 77 Collection V3</a> by Corgopolis (Weapons &gt; Attachment Catalog &gt; Barrels &amp; Muzzles).</em></p>"
